{{!-- CSV-only template (ETP-4899) — genuine comma-separated text, not the HTML/PDF page
      dumped verbatim. Same flat shape, columns and header label keys as
      template-excel.hbs (keep them in sync): the tree indent becomes a plain "Depth"
      column since CSV cannot express indentation, and "Type" (ETP-5663) is the
      account's ElementLevel label, or "Total" for a formula heading — see the Excel
      template for both and for the helpers the Type cell uses. Amounts
      print the raw dot-decimal value (no formatCurrency). Every text field goes through
      the canonical csvField (formula neutralization + quoting) — and every csvField
      call MUST be triple-stashed ({{{ }}}), never {{ }}: Handlebars HTML-escapes
      double-stash output by default, which turns csvField's own escaped `""` into
      `&quot;&quot;`, corrupting the CSV.
      Variation columns (ETP-6080): only with a comparison AND only for a
      contract that declares `labels.variationAmount` (Profit & Loss; the
      Balance Sheet shares this file byte for byte and has no variation yet).
      Raw values like the amounts, rounded to 2 decimals (round2); an empty cell when there is no % (reference 0).
      Period columns (ETP-6239): with `meta.periods` the amount columns become one group per
      bucket (every bucket, the range total last), each `label`, and with a comparison also
      `label Compared (compared period)`, `label Var.` and `label Var. %`, every header through csvField. The Balance
      Sheet copy keeps the same loops, which come out empty for it (it never sends `periods`). --}}{{#with meta}}{{{csvField labels.hdrGroup}}},{{{csvField labels.hdrDepth}}},{{{csvField labels.hdrType}}},{{{csvField labels.hdrCode}}},{{{csvField labels.hdrName}}}{{#if periods}}{{#each (periodOrder periods) as |idx|}}{{#with (periodLabel (lookup @root.meta.periods idx) @root.meta.params.columns @root.meta.locale @root.meta.labels.T) as |label|}},{{{csvField label}}}{{#if (periodMode @root.meta.params.compareMode)}},{{{csvField (periodCaption label (periodComparedHeader @root.meta.labels.periodCompared @root.meta.params.periods idx @root.meta.params.compareMode @root.meta.params.columns @root.meta.locale))}}},{{{csvField (periodCaption label @root.meta.labels.periodVarAmount)}}},{{{csvField (periodCaption label @root.meta.labels.periodVarPct)}}}{{/if}}{{/with}}{{/each}}{{else}},{{{csvField labels.amount}}}{{#ifCond params.compareTo '===' 'true'}},{{{csvField labels.amount_ref}}}{{#if labels.variationAmount}},{{{csvField labels.variationAmount}}},{{{csvField labels.variationPct}}}{{/if}}{{/ifCond}}{{/if}}
{{/with}}{{#each rows}}{{{csvField this.group}}},{{this.indent}},{{#if this.isFormula}}{{#ifCond this.elementlevel '===' 'E'}}{{{csvField @root.meta.labels.T}}}{{else}}{{{csvField (lookup @root.meta.labels this.elementlevel)}}}{{/ifCond}}{{else}}{{{csvField (lookup @root.meta.labels this.elementlevel)}}}{{/if}},{{{csvField this.value}}},{{{csvField this.name}}}{{#if @root.meta.periods}}{{#each (periodOrder @root.meta.periods) as |idx|}}{{#with (lookup ../cells idx) as |cell|}},{{cell.amount}}{{#if (periodMode @root.meta.params.compareMode)}}{{#with (lookup cell (periodMode @root.meta.params.compareMode)) as |ref|}},{{ref.amount}},{{round2 ref.variationAmount}},{{round2 ref.variationPct}}{{/with}}{{/if}}{{/with}}{{/each}}{{else}},{{this.amount}}{{#ifCond @root.meta.params.compareTo '===' 'true'}},{{this.amount_ref}}{{#if @root.meta.labels.variationAmount}},{{round2 this.variationAmount}},{{round2 this.variationPct}}{{/if}}{{/ifCond}}{{/if}}
{{/each}}
